  "Tap the bell to follow an item, or the item itself to see what has been measured for it.": "记录一个物品的铃声 或该物品本身 看它被测量到什么",
  "Thank you to our partners, who chose Torn PDA as their mobile interface: YATA, FFScouter and many reviving providers.": "感谢我们的合作伙伴, 他们选择Torn PDA作为他们的移动界面:YATA、FFScuter和许多复兴供应商。",
  "Thanks to the developers at Torn, Torn PDA is recognized as an official app to handle Torn links. This implies that your device will redirect them to the app by default, or open a choice dialog if you have any other eligible app for that purpose.\n\n": "多亏了Torn的开发商, Torn PDA被确认为处理Torn链接的官方应用程序。 这意味着您的设备会默认地将它们重定向到应用程序, 或者打开一个选择对话框, 如果您有其它符合此目的的应用程序。\n\n",
  "The API has been manually disabled by the developers. This normally lasts just a few minutes\n\nOtherwise, you can head to the forums of Discord to see if there is any more information available.": "开发者手动禁用了 API 。 这通常只持续几分钟\n\n否则,您可以前往不同论坛查看是否有更多可用信息。",
  "The Stakeouts section allows you configure specific alerts for players of your choice.\n\nPlease be aware that these alerts are only active while using Torn PDA. They will NOT generate notifications if the app is in the background or closed.\n\nThere is a maximum of 15 slots for targets and each one of them is updated every 30 seconds, minimizing API usage as much as practicable": "瞄准区域允许您为您选择的玩家配置特定的提醒。\n\n请注意,这些警报只有在使用Torn PDA时才会激活。 如果应用程序在背景中或关闭,它们不会生成通知。\n\n目标最多有15个空档,每个空档每30秒更新一次,尽可能尽量减少API的使用",
  "The Trade Calculator also supports external pricing workflows such as Torn Exchange and TornW3B.": "贸易计算器还支持外部定价工作流程,如Trn Exchange和TrnW3B。",
  "The browser supports full screen, which can be activated from the quick menu tab in the tab bar. \n\nTo access this feature, you need to have 'tabs' enabled in the Advanced Browser Settings section (in the app's Settings menu).": "浏览器支持全屏, 可以在制表符栏的快速菜单选项卡中激活。 \n\n要访问此功能, 您需要在高级浏览器设置区域( 应用程序的设置菜单中) 启用“ tabs ” 。",
  "The browser will open both after a short tap or a long-press in any of the widgets that redirect to Torn, as explained in the previous Tip. By default, a short-tap will open the browser in a windowed mode, whereas a long-press will launch it in full screen mode.\n\nYou can change this behavior in Settings. There is also more information about the full screen mode in another Tip below.": "如上一个提示所解释的那样,浏览器在短时间点击后会打开,或者在任何导出重定向到Torn的部件中打开长时按键。 默认情况下, 短消息会以窗口模式打开浏览器, 而长消息会以全屏模式启动。\n\n您可以在设置中改变这种行为。 以下另一个提示中还有更多关于全屏模式的信息。",
  "There are several ways to exit full screen mode:\n\n• Long-press the ellipsis (...) button in the tab bar (when visible) - it will be shown circled and with an orange color\n\n• Use the Floating Action Button if enabled in settings\n\n• Swipe down from the top of the screen (not available on all devices)\n\n• Double-click on Torn's top header bar. This is a convenient alternative method that works by double-clicking on the black bar at the top of Torn's page (where the Torn logo is shown). This can be particularly useful when you don't have tabs or the Floating Action Button enabled, or when the swipe gesture doesn't work on your device.": "退出全屏模式有几种方法:\n\n• 在制表栏(可见时)按下剪贴(.)按钮(.),长按省略号(.)-将显示圆形和橙色\n\n• 如果在设置中启用,则使用浮动动作按钮\n\n• 从屏幕顶部掉下来(无法在所有装置上提供)\n\n• 双击Torn顶部信头栏。 这是一种方便的替代方法,可以双击Torn页面顶部(显示Torn标志)的黑条。 当您没有制表符或浮动动作按钮启用时, 或当擦拭手势对您的设备不起作用时, 这特别有用。",
  "There are several ways:\n\nIf you would like to browse to a specific section in Torn, you can tap or long-press most of the widgets in the apps (e.g.: life and nerve bars). This will automatically switch to the browser view and navigate to your desired section.\n\nIf you just want to open Torn to resume your browsing session where you left it, you can just tap the white Torn PDA icon in the app bar, which will show the browser as it was left the last time.": "有几种方式:\n\n如果您想要浏览到Torn的某个特定区域, 您可以在应用程序( 例如: 生命和神经棒) 中点击或长时间按下大部分部件。 这将自动切换到浏览器视图并浏览到您想要的部分。\n\n如果您只想打开Torn, 以恢复您放入的浏览会话, 您可以在应用程序栏中点击白色的Torn PDA 图标, 这将显示浏览器是上次留下的。",
  "There are several ways: you can either swipe your finger right or left across the title bar or double-tap any tab (while selected) and use the arrows in the vertical menu that appears.": "有几种方法: 您可以在标题栏上右转手指或左转手指, 或者双调任何标签( 在选中时) 并使用垂直菜单中的箭头。",
  "There are three different browser styles in Torn PDA: the 'default', the 'bottom bar' and the 'dialog' styles. \n\nThey resemble the looks of the former 'full' and 'quick' browsers in previous versions of the app, but they all share the same functionality today (including chaining).\n\nThe 'default' style makes use of the app bar (positioned at the top or at the bottom, depending on the user settings) to show the page title and main icons. Be aware that in this style, you need to swipe left/right across the title bar if you wish to browse forward or back. Or, alternatively (valid for all styles) you can double tap the active tab to gain access to back/forward navigation as well.\n\nThe 'bottom' bar style places a smaller bar at the bottom to gain some space, but does not show the page title. Instead, a long press in the 'CLOSE' button is necessary to access some of the options that are available in the 'default' style with a tab in the title bar. In this style you'll also have a couple of extra icons available to browse back or forward.\n\nThe 'dialog' style is similar to the bottom bar style, but the browser is positioned inside of a dialog, which makes it a bit narrower and looks exactly as the old 'quick browser'.": "Torn PDA 有三种不同的浏览器样式: “ 默认” 、 “ 底端栏” 和“ 对话框” 样式。 \n\n它们与前一版应用程序“ full” 和“ quickk” 浏览器的外观相似, 但如今它们都拥有相同的功能(包括链路) 。\n\n“ 默认” 样式使用应用程序栏( 位于顶部或底部, 取决于用户设置) 来显示页面标题和主图标。 请注意,在这种样式中,如果您想往前或向后浏览,需要刷过标题栏的左/右侧。 或者(对所有样式有效)您可以双倍点击活动标签,以获得后向/前向导航访问权限。\n\n“ 底部” 条形样式在底部设置了一个较小的条形, 以获得一定的空间, 但是没有显示页面标题。 相反,在“ CLOSE” 按钮中按下较长的按键对于访问“ 默认” 样式中可用的一些选项和标题栏中的标签是必要的。 在这种风格下,您还会有另外几个图标可以向后浏览或向前浏览。\n\n“ 对话框” 样式与底部栏样式相似, 但浏览器位于对话框内, 这使得它更窄一些, 并且看起来和旧的“ 快速浏览器” 完全一样。",
  "There is a Terminal window (read only) available for development use (so that you can see scripts or section outputs). To activate it, short tap the title bar to open a small dialog with several options.": "有一个终端窗口(只读)可供开发使用(以便您可以看到脚本或部分输出)。 要激活它, 只需短时间点击标题栏, 就可以打开一个包含多个选项的小对话框。",
  "There is a lot to explore!": "还有很多要探索的!",
