  "There was an issues recovering your user preferences from the server.\n\nThis might happen if your device lost or tried to restore data from a backup.\n\nTorn PDA managed to recover your user, but Alerts (automatic notifications) could not be restored.\n\nPlease reconfigure them in the Alerts section.": "从服务器上找到您的用户偏好时遇到了问题。\n\n如果您的设备丢失或试图从备份中恢复数据, 可能会发生这种情况。\n\nTorn PDA 成功恢复了您的用户, 但提醒( 自动通知) 无法恢复。\n\n请在警报科重新配置",
  "This '...' button appears in your tab bar and is relevant to access several functions. If used correctly, it can also speed up several tasks.\n\nYou can tap it to show a quick list of quick actions, including shortcuts, access to the full screen mode and a tap wipe tool.\n\nThere are also a few important quick shortcuts:\n\nDouble tap the button any time to get quick access to the shortcuts dialog\n\nWhen in full screen mode, long-press the button (it will be shown circled and with an orange color) to revert to windowed mode immediately": "此“...” 按钮出现在您的制表符栏中, 与访问多个函数相关。 如果使用正确,它也可以加快若干任务。\n\n你可以监听它,以显示快速行动快速清单,包括捷径、全屏模式访问和擦拭工具。\n\n也有一些重要的捷径:\n\n随时双击按钮以快速访问快捷键对话框\n\n在全屏幕模式下, 当整个屏幕模式中, 长按下按钮( 它将被显示为圆形, 并带有橙色) 立即返回到窗口模式",
