  "Torn PDA - Tips": "撕Torn PDA - 提示",
  "Torn PDA allows you to save and share files from the browser.\n\nIn some mobile devices and/or operating systems, accessing your downloaded files is not always easy (and in some cases restricted to rooted devices or only by requesting high-level permissions from the user).\n\nTo make things easier, the default action when a file is downloaded is to initiate a share request, so that the user can share it or use the dialog to save locally with a file explorer app. The cache files that are generated with this are automatically emptied by Torn PDA.\n\nIf you decide to 'save' files locally, make sure that you can access them in the app's data folder, since Torn PDA won't delete the file cache automatically in this case.": "撕Torn PDA 允许您从浏览器中保存和共享文件。\n\n在一些移动设备和(或)操作系统中,访问下载的文档并不总是容易的(在某些情况下,仅限于扎根设备,或者只要求用户提供高级别许可)。\n\n为使事情更容易化,下载文件时的默认动作是启动共享请求,这样用户可以共享它,或者使用对话框以本地保存文件浏览器应用程序。 以此生成的缓存文件由 Torn PDA 自动清空。\n\n如果您决定在本地保存“ save” 文件, 请确定您可以在应用程序的数据文件夹中访问它们, 因为 Torn PDA 不会在此情况下自动删除文件缓存。",
  "Torn PDA has been developed as an assistant for players of TORN City. It was conceived to enhance the experience of playing Torn from a mobile platform.": "Torn PDA 是面向 Torn City 玩家的移动助手，让你在手机上更方便地游玩 Torn。",
  "Torn PDA is retrying automatically. If you have good Internet connectivity, it might be an issue with Torn's API.": "撕Torn PDA 正在自动重试。 如果你有良好的互联网连通性, 可能与Torn的API有问题。",
  "Torn PDA needs Internet access to continue": "被撕烂的PDA需要继续上网",
  "Torn PDA supports what's called deep linking or custom URLs. You can create a link outside of the application with the following scheme 'tornpda://', where the rest of the URL remains unchanged.\n\nExample: 'tornpda://www.torn.com/gym.php' should be recognized as a valid URL and open Torn PDA with a browser pointing to the gym.\n\nIn order for this to work in some browser (e.g.: Chrome), you'll need to adapt your link to be similar to this example:\n\n": "撕开的 PDA 支持所谓的深连接或自定义 URL 。 您可以在应用程序之外与以下的“ tranpda://” 方案创建一个链接, 其余的 URL 保持不变。\n\n例如:`trampda://www.rotr.com/gym.php'应被确认为有效的 URL 和打开的Torn式PDA, 浏览器指向健身房。\n\n为了让这个在某个浏览器(例如:铬)中发挥作用, 您需要调整您的链接, 使其与此示例相似 :\n\n",
