  "We can't sync your settings": "我们不能同步您的设置",
  "We encountered a problem loading your user scripts. To protect your data, please restart the app so that we can try again.\n\nIf this happens repeatedly, please go to 'Settings > Advanced Browser Settings > Manage Scripts' to reset them, or alternatively import a local or cloud backup if you have one.": "我们遇到一个问题 装载您的用户脚本。 为了保护您的数据, 请重新启动应用程序, 这样我们就可以再试一次。\n\n如果这种情况反复发生, 请前往“ 设置 > 高级浏览器设置 > 管理脚本” 重置它们, 或者如果您有的话, 也可以导入本地备份或云备份。",
  "We're reloading your preferences from the server": "我们正在重新加载您在服务器上的首选项",
  "What's New:": "什么是新:",
  "Whenever you access the browser from a target attack request (in the Chaining section), your first browser tab will be converted to a special 'chaining tab', with additional icons at the top (*) that will allow you to continue from one target to another, until you reach the end of your list.\n\nPlease be aware that you can stop your chain session at any time by long-pressing the play/pause button at the right corner (*) of your app bar.\n\nIt is not recommended to use this tab for normal day-to-day widget usage (such us quick items, crimes, etc.) since it can lack some of the normal features in certain cases. Instead, it is better to stop the chain session or use another tab.\n\n(*): Please note that chain control buttons are also accesible if you tap/double tap your first browser tab while chaining, which makes them also easily accesible if you are using the full screen mode.": "当您从目标攻击请求( 连击部分) 访问浏览器时, 您的第一个浏览器标签将被转换为特殊的“ 连击标签 ” , 在顶部 (*) 加上更多的图标, 允许您继续从一个目标到另一个目标, 直到您到达列表的末尾。\n\n请注意,您可以通过在应用程序栏右角(*)按下播放/暂停按钮,随时停止连击会话。\n\n不建议使用这个标签作为日常正常部件使用(例如我们快速物品、犯罪等),因为在某些情况下它可能缺乏一些正常特征。 相反,最好停止连击会话或使用另一个标签。\n\n(*):请注意,链控按钮如果在链锁时点击/双击首个浏览器标签,也可以使用链控按钮,这样,如果使用全屏模式,也很容易使用链控按钮。",
  "Wipe": "擦去",
  "Wipe friends list": "擦除文件夹列表",
  "Would you like to collaborate?": "你想合作吗?",
  "You DO NOT HAVE Faction API access\n\n": "您没有地区 API 访问权限\n\n",
  "You HAVE Faction API access\n\n": "您有地区API 访问权限\n\n",
  "You are not enrolled in any education course!": "您没有参加任何教育课程!",
  "You can activate the pull to refresh functionality for the main browser in Settings.\n\nThere are certain (short) pages in Torn, with no scroll, that might not activate this feature; if that's the case, try pulling down from Torn's appbar at the very top!": "您可以激活拉动来刷新设置中主浏览器的功能。\n\nTorn有某些( 短) 页面, 没有滚动, 可能无法激活此特性; 如果是这样的话, 请尝试从Torn的顶部应用程序下拉 !",
  "You can change the home widget theme in the Settings menu in Torn PDA!": "您可以在 Torn PDA 的设置菜单中更改主部件主题 !",
  "You can choose between 'external' and 'in-app' browser. This is accomplished in the Settings section.\n\nThe earlier will open your mobile phone's default browser application, but you will lose most functionalities in Torn PDA (such as quick crimes, trades calculator, city finder...)": "您可以在“ 外部” 和“ 在应用程序中” 浏览器之间选择。 这在设置区域完成。\n\n更早的会打开您的移动电话默认浏览器应用程序, 但您将失去在Torn PDA 中的大多数功能( 如快速犯罪、 交易计算器、 城市查找器... ) 。",
  "You can still try to access Torn through shortcuts or the main menu icon below.": "您仍然可以尝试通过快捷键或主菜单图标在下面访问 Torn 。",
  "You can still try to visit the website:": "您仍可尝试访问网站:",
  "You can use custom userscripts with Torn PDA. For more information, please visit the userscripts section in Settings & Advanced Browser Settings.\n\nAs a general rule, Torn PDA supports standard Javascript and jQuery, but it does not include any external libraries that are served in frameworks such as GM or TM. Therefore, if you are trying to use a script that was developed for another platform or that won't work in your browser console, you might need to adapt the code.\n\nMake sure to read carefully the disclaimer, as it contains instructions and limitations in case you would like to install new userscripts. In the disclaimer you will also find handy information if you are an advanced programmer and would like to understand how to implement some complex scenarios in your scripts that work with Torn PDA (including GET, POST, JS evaluation and some Grease Monkey handlers).\n\nThere is a list of several userscripts examples at ": "您可以使用刻录 PDA 的自定义用户标本。 如欲了解更多信息,请访问设置和高级浏览器设置中的用户标本部分。\n\n作为一般规则,Torn PDA支持标准Javascript和jQuery,但不包括在全球机制或TM等框架内服务的任何外部图书馆。 因此,如果你试图使用为另一个平台开发的脚本或者在浏览器控制台无法工作的脚本,你可能需要修改代码。\n\n确保仔细阅读免责声明,因为其中含有指示和限制,以防您想要安装新的用户标本。 在免责声明中,如果你是高级程序员,你也会发现有用的信息,并且想了解如何在与Torn PDA合作的脚本(包括Get、POST、JS评估和一些Grease Monkey操作员)中执行一些复杂的方案。\n\n下图中列出了几个用户脚本的例子。 ",
  "You don't have a job! You can get one in the ": "你没工作! 你可以得到一个在 ",
  "You have added the Torn PDA widget!\n\nHow it stays up to date:\n\n- iOS decides how often widgets refresh, usually every 15 to 30 minutes while the widget is on screen. Low Power Mode can delay it further.\n\n- Between refreshes, your bars keep filling on their own and timers (hospital, travel, chain) count down live.\n\n- If you spend energy or nerve in Torn PDA, the widget catches up as soon as you leave the app.\n\n- If you play from another device, it catches up on its next refresh. On iOS 26 or later, Torn PDA can also ask iOS to refresh it when something changes, but iOS has the final word.\n\n- Tap the refresh icon to update right away. The time next to it shows when the data was fetched.\n\nLong press the widget and choose Edit Widget to show your shortcuts, your money or pick the lock screen bar. You can also add your shortcuts to Control Center.": "您添加了Torn PDA 部件 !\n\n如何不断更新:\n\n- iOS决定部件的更新频率,通常每15至30分钟一次,而部件在屏幕上。 低功率模式可以进一步拖延。\n\n- 在清新之间,你的酒吧 不断填满自己的 和计时器(医院,旅行,链) 倒数现场。\n\n- 如果你在Torn PDA里花费能量或神经 部件一离开应用程序就赶上了\n\n- 如果你从另一个装置上玩, 它会赶上它的下一个刷新。 在iOS 26或以后,Torn PDA也可以要求iOS在有变化时刷新它,但iOS有最后的词。\n\n- 立即将刷新图标放入更新中 下次显示数据获取时间。\n\n按下部件并选择 编辑 部件以显示您的快捷键、 您的钱或选择锁屏栏。 您也可以将快捷键添加到控制中心。",
  "You have installed your first home screen widget!\n\nPlease be aware that you can change several options (such as the theme) in the Settings menu here in the main app.\n\nAlso, don't forget to visit the Tips section as there are a few hints and recommendations regarding battery consumption, refresh timer restrictions and others.": "您已经安装了您的第一个家庭屏幕部件 !\n\n请注意, 您可以在主应用程序中的设置菜单中更改多个选项( 如主题) 。\n\n也不要忘记访问Tips部分, 因为有一些关于电池消耗、更新计时限制等的提示和建议。",
